",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#a-note-on-persistence","className":"font-body text-sm text-grey-DEFAULT hover:text-orange-DEFAULT transition-colors flex items-baseline gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-[0.5rem] text-orange-DEFAULT/80","children":["08","."]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"A Note on Persistence"}]]}]}]]}]]}],[["$","h2","0",{"id":"what-is-state-akin-to-sleep-sats","className":"scroll-mt-24 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"What Is State Akin to Sleep (SATS)?"}],["$","p","1",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["State Akin to Sleep — SATS — is a technique popularized by Neville Goddard to bridge the gap between the conscious and subconscious mind. By entering a hypnagogic state of deep relaxation, individuals can impress their desires upon their inner self to manifest specific realities."]}],["$","p","2",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["The hypnagogic state is the threshold between wakefulness and sleep. In this window, your brainwaves slow from Beta (active, analytical) to Theta (4–8 Hz), the critical factor — the analytical, doubting part of your mind — falls dormant, and the subconscious becomes fully open to new instruction."]}],["$","p","3",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["This is not meditation. It is not visualization in the traditional sense. It is a precise, nightly practice of planting a seed directly into the subconscious — without the interference of the conscious mind's objections."]}],["$","p","4",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Neville Goddard taught this for decades. Modern neuroscience has confirmed the mechanism: the Theta state corresponds with heightened neuroplasticity, accelerated learning, and reduced resistance to new belief formation."]}],["$","h2","5",{"id":"why-sats-works","className":"scroll-mt-24 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Why SATS Works"}],["$","p","6",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Your subconscious mind governs approximately 95% of your behavior, reactions, and the habitual lens through which you interpret reality. It does not reason or analyze. It simply accepts what is repeatedly impressed upon it — especially when those impressions are accompanied by strong feeling."]}],["$","p","7",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["The problem is that during waking hours, the conscious mind acts as a gatekeeper. Every new belief you try to install gets interrogated: ",["$","em","1",{"className":"text-white/90 italic","children":"Is this true? Do I really deserve this? Has this happened before?"}]," The critical factor intercepts and rejects what doesn't match your existing programming."]}],["$","p","8",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["SATS bypasses this completely. In the hypnagogic state, the gatekeeper is asleep. The impressions you make in SATS go directly into the subconscious — where they take root without resistance."]}],["$","h2","9",{"id":"the-three-elements-of-effective-sats","className":"scroll-mt-24 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"The Three Elements of Effective SATS"}],["$","h3","10",{"className":"font-display text-xl md:text-2xl tracking-[0.03em] text-orange-DEFAULT mt-8 mb-3","children":"1. A Clear Objective"}],["$","p","11",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Before anything else, you must define precisely what you want to manifest. Not a vague desire, but a specific outcome."]}],["$","ul","12",{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3 my-6","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Vague:"}]," \"I want more money\""]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Specific:"}]," \"I have a thriving business generating consistent monthly income\""]}]]}]]}],["$","ul","13",{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3 my-6","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Vague:"}]," \"I want a relationship\""]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Specific:"}]," \"I am in a loving, secure relationship with someone who values and cherishes me\""]}]]}]]}],["$","p","14",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["The specificity trains the subconscious to look for exactly the right bridge of incidents. Vague instructions produce vague results."]}],["$","h3","15",{"className":"font-display text-xl md:text-2xl tracking-[0.03em] text-orange-DEFAULT mt-8 mb-3","children":"2. A Brief Imaginary Scene That Implies the Goal Is Achieved"}],["$","p","16",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["This is the heart of SATS. You construct a brief scene — a single moment in time — that implies your desire has already been fulfilled."]}],["$","p","17",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"The key word is \"implies.\""}]," You are not watching yourself receive the desire. You are living inside a moment that could only exist if the desire were already real."]}],["$","ul","18",{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3 my-6","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Hearing a trusted friend say: ",["$","em","1",{"className":"text-white/90 italic","children":"\"I knew you'd get it — congratulations.\""}],""]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Looking down at your phone and seeing a message confirming the deal, the relationship, the healing."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Feeling the weight of keys in your hand as you unlock a new home or car."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Sitting quietly in the feeling of relief and satisfaction — the feeling that comes ",["$","em","1",{"className":"text-white/90 italic","children":"after"}]," the desire arrives."]}]]}]]}],["$","ul","19",{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3 my-6","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["A movie of the process of getting there"]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["A scene where you are wishing, hoping, or asking"]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["A long narrative with many moving parts"]}]]}]]}],["$","p","20",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Keep it short — 10 to 30 seconds when looped. The simpler the scene, the more effectively it loops in the hypnagogic state."]}],["$","h3","21",{"className":"font-display text-xl md:text-2xl tracking-[0.03em] text-orange-DEFAULT mt-8 mb-3","children":"3. Sensory Vividness Repeated Until It Feels Real"}],["$","p","22",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Once you have your scene, you enter SATS and repeat it — gently, naturally, without force — until it carries the feeling of reality."]}],["$","ul","23",{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3 my-6","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["What do you ",["$","em","1",{"className":"text-white/90 italic","children":"see"}]," (from the inside, not watching yourself)?"]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["What do you ",["$","em","1",{"className":"text-white/90 italic","children":"hear"}]," — words, sounds, ambient noise?"]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["What do you ",["$","em","1",{"className":"text-white/90 italic","children":"feel"}]," physically — textures, temperatures, the felt sense of your body?"]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Most importantly: what is the ",["$","em","1",{"className":"text-white/90 italic","children":"emotional tone"}],"? The quiet satisfaction. The relief. The joy. The settledness of having arrived."]}]]}]]}],["$","p","24",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["It is the ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"feeling"}]," that the subconscious registers as real. Imagery is simply the delivery mechanism. If you cannot visualize clearly, lean entirely into the emotional tone of the scene. That alone is sufficient."]}],["$","h2","25",{"id":"step-by-step-sats-practice","className":"scroll-mt-24 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Step-by-Step SATS Practice"}],["$","h3","26",{"className":"font-display text-xl md:text-2xl tracking-[0.03em] text-orange-DEFAULT mt-8 mb-3","children":"Before You Begin (10 minutes before bed)"}],["$","p","27",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Choose and rehearse your scene."}]," Sit quietly and mentally step into your chosen scene while still fully awake. Practice until you can hold it for 15–30 seconds with some emotional resonance. This rehearsal means you don't have to construct it from scratch when you're drowsy."]}],["$","h3","28",{"className":"font-display text-xl md:text-2xl tracking-[0.03em] text-orange-DEFAULT mt-8 mb-3","children":"Step 1: Enter the Relaxation Phase (3–5 minutes)"}],["$","p","29",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Lie down in your sleep position. Close your eyes."]}],["$","ul","30",{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3 my-6","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Feet and calves — release all tension"]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Thighs and hips — let them sink into the bed"]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Stomach and chest — soften with each exhale"]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Shoulders, arms, hands — let them become heavy"]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Neck and face — unclench the jaw, release the eyes"]}]]}]]}],["$","p","31",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["You are not trying to stay awake. You are cooperating with the body's natural relaxation while keeping a thread of awareness."]}],["$","h3","32",{"className":"font-display text-xl md:text-2xl tracking-[0.03em] text-orange-DEFAULT mt-8 mb-3","children":"Step 2: Recognize the Hypnagogic State (Watch for the Signs)"}],["$","p","33",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["You will know you are entering the hypnagogic state when:"]}],["$","ul","34",{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3 my-6","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Thoughts become less controlled and more dreamlike"]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Brief, spontaneous images appear (hypnagogic imagery)"]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Your body feels heavy, distant, or numb"]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Time begins to feel elastic"]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["The boundary between thinking and experiencing softens"]}]]}]]}],["$","p","35",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["This is your signal to gently introduce the scene."]}],["$","h3","36",{"className":"font-display text-xl md:text-2xl tracking-[0.03em] text-orange-DEFAULT mt-8 mb-3","children":"Step 3: Enter the Scene (First Person, Present Tense)"}],["$","p","37",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Do not watch yourself in the scene from the outside. Step inside it as if it is happening right now."]}],["$","p","38",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Feel yourself there. Hear the words if there are any. Let the emotional tone fill your body — the satisfaction, the peace, the quiet knowing that this is real."]}],["$","p","39",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Do not analyze. Do not question whether it is working. Simply be in the scene."]}],["$","h3","40",{"className":"font-display text-xl md:text-2xl tracking-[0.03em] text-orange-DEFAULT mt-8 mb-3","children":"Step 4: Loop Gently"}],["$","p","41",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Replay the scene as it ends. Not mechanically — naturally, the way a favorite song replays in your mind without effort."]}],["$","p","42",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Each loop, lean more into the feeling than the imagery. If your mind wanders (and it will), notice it without frustration and return to the scene. Wandering is not failure — it is the nature of the hypnagogic state."]}],["$","h3","43",{"className":"font-display text-xl md:text-2xl tracking-[0.03em] text-orange-DEFAULT mt-8 mb-3","children":"Step 5: Fall Asleep in the Scene"}],["$","p","44",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["The ideal outcome: the last thing your conscious mind holds is the scene, and you drift into sleep from within it."]}],["$","p","45",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["If you fall asleep before completing the loop, that is fine. The impression has been made."]}],["$","h2","46",{"id":"common-mistakes-and-how-to-fix-them","className":"scroll-mt-24 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Common Mistakes and How to Fix Them"}],["$","p","47",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Mistake: Making the scene too long."}],"\nA scene longer than 30 seconds is hard to loop. Cut it to a single decisive moment."]}],["$","p","48",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Mistake: Watching yourself from outside."}],"\nYou are inside the experience, not observing it. If you notice you're watching yourself, step into the scene from the first person."]}],["$","p","49",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Mistake: Trying too hard."}],"\nEffort creates tension. Tension keeps you in Beta and prevents the Theta state. The goal is ease. Let the scene arise naturally, like a familiar memory."]}],["$","p","50",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Mistake: Quitting after a few days with no results."}],"\nCurrent 3D reality is an echo of past thoughts — typically 60 to 90 days behind your internal shifts. A few days of SATS is a seed. Give it time to grow."]}],["$","p","51",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Mistake: Changing the scene constantly."}],"\nChoose one scene and commit to it for at least 30 days. Consistency builds subconscious consensus. Switching scenes is like planting seeds in the same spot, digging them up, and replanting different ones."]}],["$","p","52",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Mistake: Doing SATS from a place of desperation."}],"\nThe feeling you bring to SATS is what gets impressed. Desperation impresses lack. Ease and satisfaction impress fulfillment. If you feel desperate, spend a few minutes in gratitude for something already present before entering the scene."]}],["$","h2","53",{"id":"how-long-before-you-see-results","className":"scroll-mt-24 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"How Long Before You See Results?"}],["$","p","54",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["This varies. Some practitioners report changes within days — synchronicities, unexpected opportunities, shifts in how others treat them. Others report the bridge forming over weeks or months."]}],["$","ul","55",{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3 my-6","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Depth of the old program."}]," A belief held for 40 years takes more repetition to dissolve than one held for 4."]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Consistency of practice."}]," Nightly practice is far more effective than occasional sessions."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Feeling quality."}]," A session with genuine emotional resonance outweighs ten sessions done mechanically."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":"✦"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"text-white font-semibold","children":"Persistence through the delay."}]," The echo delay means results arrive after a gap. Those who persist through the gap see the bridge."]}]]}]]}],["$","p","56",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["The consistent finding among long-term practitioners: results are not random. They correlate directly with the quality and consistency of the internal state maintained."]}],["$","h2","57",{"id":"your-nightly-sats-checklist","className":"scroll-mt-24 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"Your Nightly SATS Checklist"}],["$","p","58",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Use this before each practice:"]}],["$","ul","59",{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3 my-6 bg-black-2 border border-orange-DEFAULT/20 p-6","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":16,"height":16,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-square-check-big text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":[["$","path","1pflzl",{"d":"m9 11 3 3L22 4"}],["$","path","1jnkn4",{"d":"M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","span",null,{"children":["I have chosen a specific desire to impress tonight"]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":16,"height":16,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-square-check-big text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":[["$","path","1pflzl",{"d":"m9 11 3 3L22 4"}],["$","path","1jnkn4",{"d":"M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","span",null,{"children":["I have a brief, specific scene that implies the desire is fulfilled"]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":16,"height":16,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-square-check-big text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":[["$","path","1pflzl",{"d":"m9 11 3 3L22 4"}],["$","path","1jnkn4",{"d":"M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","span",null,{"children":["I have rehearsed the scene while awake"]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":16,"height":16,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-square-check-big text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":[["$","path","1pflzl",{"d":"m9 11 3 3L22 4"}],["$","path","1jnkn4",{"d":"M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","span",null,{"children":["My body is fully relaxed before I introduce the scene"]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":16,"height":16,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-square-check-big text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":[["$","path","1pflzl",{"d":"m9 11 3 3L22 4"}],["$","path","1jnkn4",{"d":"M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","span",null,{"children":["I am in the scene from the first person (not watching myself)"]}]]}],["$","li","5",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":16,"height":16,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-square-check-big text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":[["$","path","1pflzl",{"d":"m9 11 3 3L22 4"}],["$","path","1jnkn4",{"d":"M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","span",null,{"children":["I am looping the scene with feeling, not force"]}]]}],["$","li","6",{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 font-body text-grey-DEFAULT","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":16,"height":16,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-square-check-big text-orange-DEFAULT mt-1 flex-shrink-0","children":[["$","path","1pflzl",{"d":"m9 11 3 3L22 4"}],["$","path","1jnkn4",{"d":"M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","span",null,{"children":["I am falling asleep from within the scene"]}]]}]]}],["$","h2","60",{"id":"a-note-on-persistence","className":"scroll-mt-24 font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-[0.03em] text-white mt-12 mb-4","children":"A Note on Persistence"}],["$","p","61",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["The most important single factor in SATS is showing up each night — especially on the nights when nothing has changed externally, when doubt is loudest, when the 3D reality seems to contradict everything you're doing."]}],["$","p","62",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Those are the nights that matter most. The subconscious is recording your persistence as a belief: ",["$","em","1",{"className":"text-white/90 italic","children":"\"This person is serious. This is real to them.\""}]," And it adjusts accordingly."]}],["$","p","63",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["You are not pretending. You are not lying to yourself. You are choosing — deliberately and consistently — which state of consciousness you will inhabit. And consciousness creates reality."]}],["$","p","64",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["This is the complete practice. Everything else is detail."]}],["$","p","65",{"className":"font-body text-grey-DEFAULT leading-relaxed mb-5 text-[1.05rem]","children":["Start tonight."]}]],["$","section",null,{"aria-labelledby":"faq-heading","className":"mt-16 pt-10 border-t border-white/10","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[0.52rem] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-orange-DEFAULT mb-2","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":13,"height":13,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","st